{"seq":5,"slug":"retention-churn-support","title":"留存、流失与客户支持","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","categoryLabel":"独立开发与上架","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 留存、流失与客户支持 简介\n\n留住用户比获取用户更根本——留不住的产品像漏水桶，再多获客也存不住。本 hub 面向想让 app 可持续增长的独立开发者，从引导与激活（啊哈时刻与价值时间、onboarding 设计、激活指标）讲起，覆盖留存机制（留存为何是根本、习惯回路与参与、留存曲线）、流失诊断（群组分析、用户为什么离开、流失调查与信号），以及客服即留存（单人团队支持、AI 优先客服、支持即留存）。它聚焦留存/参与/客服，与「订阅、定价与计费」hub 的流失感知定价互补。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：先补桶再加水（留存优先）、尽快让用户体验核心价值、用数据诊断流失对症下药、把支持从成本变成留存引擎——并守住「健康参与而非成瘾操纵」的底线。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-activation","title":"Onboarding Activation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aha-moment-and-ttv","title":"啊哈时刻与价值时间","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation/aha-moment-and-ttv","wordCount":1851,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-design","title":"引导流程设计","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation/onboarding-design","wordCount":1855,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"activation-metrics","title":"激活指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/onboarding-activation/activation-metrics","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲引导与激活：用啊哈时刻（用户第一次体验到价值的瞬间，留存最强预测因子）与价值时间(TTV，越短越好)定义留存目标、设计以「尽快让用户体验核心价值」为唯一目标且减摩擦的 onboarding，并用激活漏斗与北极星指标把「用户是否真正用起来」量化。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"retention-mechanics","title":"Retention Mechanics","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-retention-matters","title":"留存为何是根本","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics/why-retention-matters","wordCount":1937,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"habit-loops-and-engagement","title":"习惯回路与参与","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics/habit-loops-and-engagement","wordCount":1980,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"retention-curves","title":"留存曲线","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/retention-mechanics/retention-curves","wordCount":1954,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲留存机制：留存是增长的真正地基（漏桶问题——先补桶再加水）、用习惯回路（触发-行动-奖励-投入）培养围绕真实价值的使用习惯（健康参与而非成瘾操纵），以及用留存曲线「是否走平」诊断产品根本健康与产品-市场契合。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"churn-diagnosis","title":"Churn Diagnosis","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/churn-diagnosis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cohort-analysis","title":"群组分析","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/churn-diagnosis/cohort-analysis","wordCount":1827,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-users-leave","title":"用户为什么离开","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/churn-diagnosis/why-users-leave","wordCount":1975,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"churn-surveys-and-signals","title":"流失调查与信号","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/churn-diagnosis/churn-surveys-and-signals","wordCount":2006,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲流失诊断：用群组分析分离不同用户群、看清哪类留得好哪类留不住及改进是否有效、按生命周期阶段（早期激活/中期习惯/后期价值）定位流失原因（深层几乎总是价值不足），以及用流失调查（事后知原因）与预警信号（事前可干预挽回）从诊断走向干预。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"support-as-retention","title":"Support As Retention","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/support-as-retention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solo-team-support","title":"单人团队的客户支持","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/support-as-retention/solo-team-support","wordCount":2221,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-first-support","title":"AI 优先的客户支持","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/support-as-retention/ai-first-support","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"support-as-retention","title":"支持即留存","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/retention-churn-support/support-as-retention/support-as-retention","wordCount":2227,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲客服即留存：单人团队靠「减少问题产生+自助化+人力用在刀刃」把支持设计成可持续系统、用 AI 优先客服扩展一个人的支持规模（基于知识库作答、留人工兜底），以及把支持从成本视角转为留存引擎——在用户最可能流失的时刻用真诚有效的支持逆转为忠诚。\n"}]}